<BaseLayout title="Abdomen Acupressure Points" description="Discover abdomen acupressure points including CV6, CV12, and ST25. Learn how to stimulate these points for digestive health, vitality, and immune support." breadcrumbs={[{"label":"Home","href":"/"},{"label":"Body Atlas","href":"/atlas/"},{"label":"Abdomen","href":"/body/abdomen-acupressure-points/"}]}>
<article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 lg:px-6">
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
    <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Body Region</span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mt-2">Abdomen</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-2">Abdominal acupressure targets the midline and lower belly to support digestion, ease bloating, and address fatigue and vitality. This guide covers five abdomen points and the safe practice guidelines for this sensitive region.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mb-10 flex justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 130" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-28 h-32"><path d="M20 5 Q50 0 80 5 L85 95 Q50 105 15 95 Z" fill="rgba(45,106,79,0.06)" stroke="#2d6a4f" stroke-width="1.5"></path><circle cx="50" cy="20" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="45" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><circle cx="35" cy="60" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><circle cx="65" cy="60" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="80" r="2" fill="#2d6a4f" opacity="0.5"></circle><text x="50" y="122" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#2d6a4f" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">Abdomen</text></svg></div>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-3">Why Abdomen Acupressure Points Matter</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">The abdomen holds the points used most often for digestive concerns such as bloating, indigestion, constipation, and nausea. CV12 and ST25 sit along the stomach and large-intestine areas, which is why they appear so consistently in the self-care routines covered on our condition pages. CV6 and CV4 on the lower midline are classically linked to energy, or qì, and vitality. Working this region can therefore feel relevant both for an unsettled stomach after a meal and for the low energy that digestive fatigue can bring.</p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">In the traditional model, the abdomen is where the mid and lower meridians nourish the digestive organs, so points here are described as regulating the smooth flow of qì for the stomach and intestines. On a physical level, gentle abdominal pressure can relax the belly wall and support the natural rhythm of digestion. The key is timing: press when the belly is relaxed and settled, not while it is full, and always wait long enough after a meal before starting.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-3">Key Points in This Region</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mb-5">These five abdominal points cover upper and lower belly concerns, from bloating and nausea to regularity and menstrual cramps. Open each card for exact positions and technique.</p>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <a href="/points/cv6-qihai-acupressure-point/" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold">CV6</div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">CV6 (Qihai)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Sea of Qi</span></h3>
          <div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Fatigue, digestive weakness, vitality</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/points/cv4-guanyuan-acupressure-point/" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold">CV4</div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">CV4 (Guanyuan)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Gate of Origin</span></h3>
          <div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Urinary issues, reproductive health</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/points/cv12-zhongwan-acupressure-point/" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold">CV12</div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">CV12 (Zhongwan)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Middle Cavity</span></h3>
          <div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Indigestion, bloating, nausea</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/points/st25-tianshu-acupressure-point/" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold">ST25</div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">ST25 (Tianshu)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Celestial Pivot</span></h3>
