        </div>
        <span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span>
      </a>      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold">ST29</div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">ST29 (Guilai)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Return</span></h3>
          <div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★☆</div>
